<title>USA: GTE says antitrust waiting period ends.</title>
<headline>GTE says antitrust waiting period ends.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTE Corp and BBN Corp said on Tuesday that the antitrust waiting period for GTE's $29 a share tender offer for BBN expired on May 31, 1997.</p>
<p>GTE started a tender offer that values BBN at $616 million on May 12, 1997.</p>
<p>The offer is conditioned upon the tender of two-thirds of the outstanding shares, GTE and BBN said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>The offer and withdrawal right are scheduled to expire midnight June 9, 1997, the companies said.</p>
</text>
